    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge, catch, and click to the beat in this fast-paced action rhythm game, where precision and movement are key!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557670/extras/a5ba6ae8add9c917abee97ee90290bdd.avif?t=1755203469\" width=400 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid <strong>Echoes</strong>, Catch <strong>Rebounders</strong>, and tap on <strong>Pulse</strong> notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay Attention</strong> - Charts can reach high speeds, making you read their challenging patterns as you go!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Mistakes</strong> - Every action is crucial. If your focus falters for even a second, you might fail a chart and have to retry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Modifiers</strong> - Find a chart too hard? Wanna practice it to ace it later? Disable failing! Slow the chart down! Want to give yourself a bigger challenge? Speed the chart up! Make one mistake be the only one you get!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete for the Top\u00a0</strong>- Gain<i> Echo Points</i> by completing charts, and see how you rank amongst other players all around the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Support</strong> - Unleash your creativity and make your own charts <i>directly in the game\u00a0</i>to share them with everyone!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge, catch, and click to the beat in this fast-paced action rhythm game, where precision and movement are key!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557670/extras/a5ba6ae8add9c917abee97ee90290bdd.avif?t=1755203469\" width=400 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid <strong>Echoes</strong>, Catch <strong>Rebounders</strong>, and tap on <strong>Pulse</strong> notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay Attention</strong> - Charts can reach high speeds, making you read their challenging patterns as you go!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Mistakes</strong> - Every action is crucial. If your focus falters for even a second, you might fail a chart and have to retry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Modifiers</strong> - Find a chart too hard? Wanna practice it to ace it later? Disable failing! Slow the chart down! Want to give yourself a bigger challenge? Speed the chart up! Make one mistake be the only one you get!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete for the Top\u00a0</strong>- Gain<i> Echo Points</i> by completing charts, and see how you rank amongst other players all around the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Support</strong> - Unleash your creativity and make your own charts <i>directly in the game\u00a0</i>to share them with everyone!</p></li></ul>",
